{"parse": {"title": "RUG-15", "pageid": 23043, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/RUG-14\" title=\"RUG-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">RUG-15</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">RUG</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">15</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BA.A2.E5.B2.A9.E6.8A.A4.E5.8D.AB.E9.98.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"红岩护卫队\">红岩护卫队</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 红岩护卫队</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Uluru Guardians</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>医<span class=\"color-value\"></span>生<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>作<span class=\"color-value\"></span>家<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>报<span class=\"color-value\"></span>刊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>亭<span class=\"color-value\"></span>老<span class=\"color-value\"></span>板<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>出<span class=\"color-value\"></span>租<span class=\"color-value\"></span>车<span class=\"color-value\"></span>司<span class=\"color-value\"></span>机<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>学<span class=\"color-value\"></span>数<span class=\"color-value\"></span>学<span class=\"color-value\"></span>老<span class=\"color-value\"></span>师<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>冶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>炼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>厂<span class=\"color-value\"></span>工<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1510115</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzinei\"><img alt=\"0xiangzinei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>所以——比赛结束之后，沙丝绒小姐去医院找了马科尔先生吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>没错！她买了所有杂志，带着去找……啊，对了，你还不知道沙丝绒和马科尔之间的故事吧——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>不，我不知道，我当时正在房间里思考白天看到的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>别——别这么看着我呀！我都说了！那么蠢的故事我只会讲一次！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>好吧，我想我不知道也没什么……那只是一个故事而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乖孩子总是让人于心不忍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙丝绒举手投降，调整了一下坐姿，拍了拍身边的座位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>好吧！我讲——我讲就是了！过来吧，小崽子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>太感谢你了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>爱兹拉很快坐在了那里，乖巧地等待着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>你们都该知道，我有很多工作，我总忙于各种工作，而这工作的后头是一个个主顾，代表着许多许多钱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>当一个人为了钱能接受“绝大部分”工作的时候，她总会遇到一些“诡异”的主顾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>比如扮演别人的母亲参加家长参观日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>又比如为盲人的视觉系猎犬编满302条辫子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>也比如——在深夜，带着价值昂贵到可以买下我整个公寓的摄影机，趴在满是露水的雨林草丛里等待一种罕见的野生鸟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我知道这种工作，有时候我在拉普拉斯的同僚也会雇佣别人帮忙收集信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>不过只要有时间，大家还是更愿意自己去森林里转转……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>是的，那家伙也是这么说的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>他给了我一笔丰厚的报酬。丰厚到让我睁着一双满是红血丝的眼睛等待着那只粉鳞火炬蜂鸟出现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>一天，两天，三天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>我都没有等到那只粉鳞火炬蜂鸟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>但是……我见到了，另一样能与之媲美的“神奇动物”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>停顿几秒，沙丝绒深深地吸入一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>那是一只——粉色闪光鸭嘴兽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>粉色的——闪光的——鸭嘴兽……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>它是粉色的，也闪鳞光，谁知道蜂鸟是不是某种“圆圆胖胖的鸭嘴兽”在鸟类爱好者之间的外号呢？——我当然拍下了它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>但是想也明白，一个鸟类爱好者是不需要鸭嘴兽的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>我把那张照片卖给了儿童趣闻杂志……然后嘛……如果你们读过足够多的俗套小说，应该就能猜到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>难……难道？那就是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>……嗯，没错，那只鸭嘴兽就是喝了幻形剂的马科尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>啊，这个……马科尔先生为什么要那样做呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>也许是兴趣，也许是意外，总之——据他自己所说，他只是被人所害，绝非个人爱好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>而那张照片被刊登在杂志上之后，他飞速辞掉了工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>他离开了自己的工作和朋友圈子，成为了一个伟大的复仇者，致力于让我品尝与他相同的痛苦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>而我呢，在这次赚了大钱之后，买下了我的公寓——还有所有的当期杂志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>嗯……你想把他们卖给马科尔先生吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>不——当然不啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>你这小子把我当成什么坏人啦！我把他从医院里带出来，找了片空地，把那些东西一把火都烧掉了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>他当时啊，哭得可大声了，哼哼～听起来真让人开心～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>幕布另一侧，年轻的女声传来，打断了对话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-502101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>沙丝绒小姐、可燃点小姐、爱兹拉先生！采访的准备已经做好了，请各位移步台前！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>啊！好的，我们这就来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们率先动身，可燃点凑近爱兹拉，小声地询问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>故事的后半段你听懂了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>不……我也不明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>哈！看来也有神秘学家和人类都不明白的东西存在啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>或许我们可以问问维尔汀，她只比我们大一点儿，但今天她不在这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>好像是和和平乌鲁女士一同去了乌卢鲁运动场……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>生吞黄金，歌舞致死，数字的冒险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>原来，在我沉睡的这些年内世界已经变成了这副模样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我曾经经历过无数雨季，瞧见乌卢鲁岩之上悬挂彩虹，却从未见过那样的“暴雨”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>火焰发出了一声温热的叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>它们……竟然能够如此轻易地改变一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但是乌卢鲁运动场没有改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我知道这世界上有些地点是神奇的，它们具有玄而不明的力量，得以在“暴雨”中开辟出一线生机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这儿正是这样的地方。这样的地方……总会成为各方争夺的资源。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>比如你所说的“重塑之手”，他们垂涎乌卢鲁，如同狼垂涎红肉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>基金会已经开展了乌卢鲁保卫队计划，因需要长期驻扎，澳大利亚分部的人员构成无法兼容如此巨大的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>而后，有许多人前往了基金会澳大利亚分部的会客窗口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>他们……担忧乌卢鲁运动场？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的。他们很担心这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他们自愿守卫与驻扎在这里，花费时间与精力守卫这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他们成为了一支由31位神秘学家，29名人类构成的“乌卢鲁岩护卫队”，他们之中有医生与作家，也有出租车司机与报刊亭老板。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……他们都是这场乌卢鲁运动会的观众。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>……呵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>孩子，你做到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>这的确是一个崭新的开端。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_at_fumoyanshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_at_fumoyanshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_at_fumoyanshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/Cg-1_5_at_fumoyanshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_at_fumoyanshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/Cg-1_5_at_fumoyanshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_at_fumoyanshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/Cg-1_5_at_fumoyanshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_at_fumoyanshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>所以我想将它留在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>本耶普化身的巨石已在乌卢鲁的红土上烘得温热。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不再能感受到一丝湿冷或是疑窦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>由背脊向两侧铺开，巨石与火凿开的细渠汇成数条句文。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>“我们将奔跑，以竞技的精神。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/60/HeadIconSmall-307601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>“我们将行走，以人最初的姿态。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁&amp;维尔汀：</div><div>“我们彼此比量，参与大过于胜利。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁&amp;维尔汀：</div><div>——人类与神秘学家共书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>无论雨幕多少次将这个世界洗刷一新，<br />无论时代、风貌与人们的生活方式如何变幻，<br />当一无所知的人群再次开启乌卢鲁运动场之时，<br />他们都将会记起它所代表的精神，所传递的信念。<br />时代的洪流中，瞬息万变，唯此永存。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "RUG-15"}}